# # /cgs/
#
# Identifiers for the Center for Geospatial Solutions (CGS).
#
# https://w3id.org/cgs/ontology/core/ redirects to
# https://cgs-earth.github.io/ontologies/
#
# e.g. https://w3id.org/cgs/ontology/core/spatiotemporal/ redirects to
# https://cgs-earth.github.io/ontologies/spatiotemporal/
#
# ## Contact
# This space is administered by:
#
# Colton Loftus
# GitHub username: C-Loftus
#
# Benjamin Webb
# GitHub username: webb-ben

RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^ontology/core/(.*)$ https://cgs-earth.github.io/ontologies/$1 [R=302,L]
